## Quality checks (run before push)

```powershell
npm run typecheck
npm run lint
npm run test
```

All three in one line:

```powershell
npm run typecheck; npm run lint; npm run test
```

Watch tests while coding:

```powershell
npm run test:watch
```

---

## Deploy to live site

**App code changes** (`src/`, config, workflows):

```powershell
npm run push-live
```

Custom commit message:

```powershell
npm run push-live -- "fix: describe your change"
```

**Map data changes** — sign in to the app and edit; data saves to Supabase immediately. No deploy step for portfolio JSON.

**Legacy JSON import** (one-time or bulk):

```powershell
npm run migrate-json-to-supabase
```

Requires `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` in `.env.local`.

Live site: https://quadreal-r.github.io/building-map-explorer/  
Actions: https://github.com/quadreal-r/building-map-explorer/actions

