## R2 media upload

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run upload-rtu-pictures-r2` | Upload RTU pictures to Cloudflare R2 |
| `npm run sync-rtu-pictures-r2` | Compare manifest vs R2, upload missing |
| `npm run upload-rtu-documents-r2` | Upload RTU documents to R2 |

